 	help
 	  Say Y here if you want support for the special keys (Fn, Numlock) on
-	  Apple iBooks, PowerBooks, MacBooks and MacBook Pros.
+	  Apple iBooks, PowerBooks, MacBooks, MacBook Pros and aluminum USB
+	  keyboards.
 
 	  If unsure, say N.
 
