-        /*
-         * Error recovery functions. examine_error() returns a value that
-         * indicates what to do for an error condition. If examine_error()
+
+	/*
+	 * Error recovery functions. examine_error() returns a value that
+	 * indicates what to do for an error condition. If examine_error()
