 /*
- *      It is hooked before NF_IP_PRI_NAT_SRC at the NF_IP_POST_ROUTING
+ *      It is hooked before NF_IP_PRI_NAT_SRC at the NF_INET_POST_ROUTING
  *      chain, and is used for VS/NAT.
